    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυκληρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be a shipowner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				598
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				6.49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρασικλῆς μαρτυρεῖ κυβερνᾶν τὴν
				ναῦν ἣν Ὑβλήσιος ἐναυκλήρει</span> Test. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.20
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτηγὸν ἧς ἐναυκλήρει Ῥωμαῖος
					ἀνήρ</span>”
